{"id":45686,"date":"2022-02-03T11:22:34","date_gmt":"2022-02-03T16:22:34","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/?p=45686"},"modified":"2022-02-03T11:28:10","modified_gmt":"2022-02-03T16:28:10","slug":"la-nintendo-switch-depasse-les-100-millions-dunites-vendues","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/la-nintendo-switch-depasse-les-100-millions-dunites-vendues\/","title":{"rendered":"La Nintendo Switch d\u00e9passe les 100 millions d&rsquo;unit\u00e9s vendues"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><strong>Nintendo a d\u00e9voil\u00e9 <a href=\"https:\/\/www.nintendo.co.jp\/ir\/en\/finance\/hard_soft\/index.html\">son plus r\u00e9cent rapport financier<\/a> et on y apprend que la Nintendo Switch a maintenant d\u00e9pass\u00e9 la Wii et la PS1 en termes de ventes totales d&rsquo;unit\u00e9s, atteignant 103.54 millions. Ceci place la console hybride de Nintendo au 5e de la console la plus vendue de tous les temps, talonnant la PlayStation 4.\u00a0<\/strong><\/p>\n<h5><em>Cr\u00e9dit images : Nintendo<\/em><\/h5>\n<p>\u00c0 part pour les consoles portables Nintendo DS, Game Boy et d\u00e9riv\u00e9s, la Nintendo Switch devient donc le plus grand succ\u00e8s de Nintendo qui est aussi une console de salon.<\/p>\n<p>En termes de ventes de jeux, Nintendo rapporte 766.41 millions d&rsquo;unit\u00e9s vendues. Mario Kart 8 Deluxe est toujours le jeu le plus populaire sur Switch avec 43.35 millions de copies vendues. \u00c0 noter que Nintendo d\u00e9voile seulement les chiffres d&rsquo;unit\u00e9s physiques vendues, le r\u00e9el chiffre serait donc beaucoup plus haut en comptabilisant les ventes num\u00e9riques du eShop.<\/p>\n<p><strong>1- Mario Kart 8 Deluxe : 43.35 millions<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>2- Animal Crossing New Horizons : 37.62 millions<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>3- Super Smash Bros. Ultimate : 27.40 millions<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>4- The Legend of Zelda : Breath of the Wild : 25.80 millions<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>5- Pok\u00e9mon Sword\/Shield : 23.90 millions<\/strong><\/p>\n<p class=\"image-wrapper\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-45688 \" src=\"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/02\/Screen-Shot-2022-02-03-at-10.57.03-AM-1024x1477.png\" alt=\"nintendo\" width=\"770\" height=\"1111\" srcset=\"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/02\/Screen-Shot-2022-02-03-at-10.57.03-AM-1024x1477.png 1024w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/02\/Screen-Shot-2022-02-03-at-10.57.03-AM-104x150.png 104w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/02\/Screen-Shot-2022-02-03-at-10.57.03-AM-500x721.png 500w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/02\/Screen-Shot-2022-02-03-at-10.57.03-AM-768x1108.png 768w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/02\/Screen-Shot-2022-02-03-at-10.57.03-AM.png 1262w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 770px) 100vw, 770px\" \/><\/p>\n<p class=\"image-wrapper\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-45687 size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/02\/Screen-Shot-2022-02-03-at-10.59.02-AM-1024x822.png\" alt=\"nintendo\" width=\"1024\" height=\"822\" srcset=\"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/02\/Screen-Shot-2022-02-03-at-10.59.02-AM-1024x822.png 1024w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/02\/Screen-Shot-2022-02-03-at-10.59.02-AM-150x120.png 150w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/02\/Screen-Shot-2022-02-03-at-10.59.02-AM-500x401.png 500w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/02\/Screen-Shot-2022-02-03-at-10.59.02-AM-768x616.png 768w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2022\/02\/Screen-Shot-2022-02-03-at-10.59.02-AM.png 1336w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/p>\n<h3>\u00c0 LIRE AUSSI :\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/jeux